# selfishDb

selfishDb is a script wich allow you to create configuration to export data from mariadb/mysql to json or xlsx

src/exportsConfig.example.ts is used as a configuration because git should not override your real configuration

## QUICKSTART

create a .env at this project root using the .env.example

create a src/exportsConfig.ts using the src/exportsConfig.example.ts (more information in this file)
